      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason I used a kernel_lto_allow_list() function is because the additional allowlist comes from a separate .cmake file (ite_allow_lto.cmake) under platform/ec/zephyr/program/..., while the base DEFAULT_LTO_ALLOWLIST is created in kernel/kernel_no_lto.cmake (https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/pull/99124).\n\nSince these are different CMake contexts, I cannot directly modify DEFAULT_LTO_ALLOWLIST from the program-level CMake file. Using a helper function was the way to pass the additional list back into kernel_no_lto.cmake via PARENT_SCOPE.\n\nTo simplify the implementation, I updated the function as patchset7",
